  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/Fw8HbmRZMzOSnb9jQFNH5Sg6laNsCwfjy3UrY1N6VSU.original.fullsize.png\"><br>\nHence $\\mathrm{K}_{\\mathrm{C}}=\\frac{(2 x)^2 \\times x}{(a-x)(1.5 a-2 x)^2}$\nGiven, at equilibrium\n$\\begin{array}{ll}\\therefore & (a-x)=(1.5 a-2 x) \\\\ \\therefore & a=2 x\\end{array}$\nOn solving $K_C=4$",
